Subject: [PATCH] tests: adapt address and URI fixtures to Meownero networks

Keep native encoding and validation unchanged; cover network/type vectors, checksums and rejection of modern Monero base58 addresses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tests/unit_tests/base58.cpp | 59 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tests/unit_tests/uri.cpp    | 10 +++++--
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/unit_tests/base58.cpp b/tests/unit_tests/base58.cpp
